AGENT_REF = r'''# awt agent reference

Lookup only. Search for the refusal text or the verb. Commands run from the task root as `./awt`.

## Which command

| Situation | Command |
|---|---|
| Starting, not a subagent | `./awt resume` |
| Need to know if it is already recorded | `./awt find "term"` |
| List one kind of thing | `./awt list refs` (also context docs outbox misc decisions questions effects notes state) |
